@startuml

skinparam componentStyle uml2

' The layers of tests/fixtures/layered_app
[Controller] <<..controller..>> #white/PowderBlue
[Service] <<..service..>> as service
component [Persistence] <<..persistence..>> as persistence #PowderBlue
[Core] <<..core..>>
[Security] <<..security..>> <<..thirdparty..>> as security
[Anticorruption] <<..anticorruption..>>

[Controller] --> service : delegates to
[Controller] -[#green]-> [Core]
service ---> persistence
service -left-> [Core]
[Core] <-- [Anticorruption]
security --> [Controller] : guards
note top on link #lightgreen: security wraps the controllers

@enduml
